		<title>Google Cloud CDN</title>
		<link>https://www.cdnpingce.com/exchange/googlecloudcdn?utm_source=rss&#038;utm_medium=rss&#038;utm_campaign=googlecloudcdn</link>
					<comments>https://www.cdnpingce.com/exchange/googlecloudcdn#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[CDN测评]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 14 Dec 2022 16:47:22 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://export.mercurytheme.com/011/?post_type=casino&#038;p=71</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Google Cloud CDN 是谷歌云平台提供的内容分发网络服务，通过其全球分布的边缘节点加速静态和动态内 [&#8230;]</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.cdnpingce.com/exchange/googlecloudcdn">Google Cloud CDN</a> first appeared on <a href="https://www.cdnpingce.com">CDN评测网</a>.</p>]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://cloud.google.com/cdn" title="">Google Cloud CDN</a> 是谷歌云平台提供的内容分发网络服务，通过其全球分布的边缘节点加速静态和动态内容的传输，显著降低用户访问延迟并提升网站性能。该服务深度集成 Google Cloud Storage（GCS）私有存储桶，支持通过 <strong>签名URL</strong> 和 <strong>访问密钥（AK/SK）</strong> 实现安全的内容分发，确保私有资源仅限授权用户访问。</p>



<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-3 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
	<div class="space-pros box-100 relative">
		<div class="space-pros-ins relative">
			<div class="space-pros-title box-100 relative">
				Pros			</div>
			<div class="space-pros-description box-100 relative">
				
<ul>
<li>深度集成Google生态</li>
<li>性能优化与协议支持</li>
<li>安全性与合规性</li>
<li>成本透明与弹性计费</li>
<li>&#8212;</li>
</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	
